- T1 accepting a current portfolio anywhere inside the interval, when its claims are closing claims - the coordinator's own spec error, which reinstated the very false fact T1 existed to prevent;
- the order-state refusal classifying every kind as Cash and Positions, leaving Income eligible after a refused dividend.

Also found while designing, not in any bead: a quarantined row reached the owner nowhere at all, so removing the abort without giving it a verdict would have turned a loud refusal into silence.

